{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03204","headline":"和刘侍郎入隆唐观 · 杨炯","name":"和刘侍郎入隆唐观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"福地阴阳合，仙都日月开。\n山川临四险，城树隐三台。\n伏槛排云出，飞轩遶涧回。\n参差凌倒影，潇洒轶浮埃。\n百果珠爲实，羣峰锦作苔。\n悬萝暗疑雾，瀑布响成雷。\n方士烧丹液，真人泛玉杯。\n还如问桃水，更似得蓬莱。\n汉帝求仙日，相如作赋才。\n自然金石奏，何必上天台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨炯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03204.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03204","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}